        "materials_heading": "Materials + Care",
        "materials_text": "<p><strong>Care Instructions for Your Plated or full gold Jewelry</strong><br/><br/>Our pieces are crafted to make a statement - and to stay with you for years. To keep their shine and spirit alive, a little mindful care goes a long way.<br/><br/>Here’s how to love them back:<br/><br/><strong>Last on, first off.</strong><br/>Put your jewelry on after applying perfume, lotion, or makeup - and take it off before undressing, showering, or sleeping.<br/><br/><strong>Keep it dry.</strong><br/>Water, humidity, and plating don’t mix. Avoid wearing your piece while swimming, bathing, or sweating.<br/><br/><strong>Soft touch only.</strong><br/>Clean gently with a soft, dry cloth after each wear to remove any natural oils or residue. No chemicals, no abrasives - just a little love.<br/><br/><strong>Store with intention.</strong><br/>Keep your piece in its Noritamy pouch or box, away from sunlight and other jewelry to prevent scratching or fading.<br/><br/><strong>Time to replate?</strong><br/>Over time, gold plating may naturally fade depending on wear. When that moment comes, we offer a re-plating service to bring your piece back to life.<br/><br/><strong>Materials: </strong></p>",
        "shipping_heading": "Shipping + Returns",
        "shipping_text": "<p>From the moment you place your order, please allow <strong>2-8 business days</strong> for our team to craft and quality-check your piece. All orders are shipped from our studio at Herzl 20, Israel. To ensure a seamless experience, we cover all related customs taxes and charges.</p><h2>Shipping Options</h2><p><strong>Economy Service (USPS in the USA):</strong> 5-14 business days once sent — Fully traceable — <strong>Free</strong></p><p><strong>DHL Express:</strong> 2-6 business days once sent — Fully traceable — <strong>$15 USD</strong></p><h2>Returns &amp; Exchanges</h2><p>Returns are accepted within 30 days of delivery, provided the item is unworn and in its original condition. For your convenience, returns are sent to our US-based address. For full details and instructions, please refer to our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-returns\">complete shipping and returns policy</a>.</p>",
